flowchart TB
    subgraph SourcePlane[Migration and Replication Plane]
        direction LR
        DB[(Migration Working DB)] --> Source[Replication Source]
        Source --> Cloud[Cloud Replication]
        Cloud --> Target[SAP Target Replication]
    end

    subgraph SAPStaging[SAP Persistent Staging Plane]
        direction TB
        Stage[(Typed Object Staging Tables)]
        Manifest[(Run and Package Manifest)]
        Queue[(Object Work Queue)]
        Results[(Object Results and Messages)]
        Target -->|Bulk replicate business data| Stage
        Target -->|Publish READY after data and counts| Manifest
        Manifest -->|Release complete objects| Queue
    end

    Catalog[SKP Object Catalog] <-->|Metadata| Scanner[Scanner]
    Scanner <-->|Trigger, status, retry, reconciliation| ControlAPI[RAP OData V4 Control API]
    ControlAPI -->|Short control transaction only| Manifest

    Scheduler[Background Scheduler or Event] --> Dispatcher[Durable Dispatcher]
    Manifest -->|Lease READY packages| Dispatcher
    Dispatcher -->|Apply capacity and backpressure limits| Queue

    subgraph WorkerPool[Bounded Parallel Worker Pool]
        direction TB
        Worker1[Worker 1]
        Worker2[Worker 2]
        WorkerN[Worker N]
    end

    Queue -->|Claim object IDs or small ranges| WorkerPool
    Stage -->|Read complete object by key| WorkerPool
    WorkerPool --> Adapter[Versioned Object Adapter]
    Registry[Object Contract and Adapter Registry] --> Adapter
    Adapter -->|Sales Order, PO, BP, Delivery, Production Order| BusinessAPI[Standard BAPI or Released API]
    BusinessAPI --> Transaction[Commit or Rollback per Object]
    Transaction --> Documents[(SAP Business Objects)]
    Transaction -->|Persist status, SAP key, timings, messages| Results
    Results -->|Monitoring and selective retry| ControlAPI
    Results -->|Finalize object and package state| Manifest

    classDef service fill:#ffffff,stroke:#315b7d,color:#111111
    classDef storage fill:#202124,stroke:#6da9d2,color:#ffffff
    classDef processing fill:#1f513e,stroke:#71c99a,color:#ffffff
    classDef transaction fill:#5c4814,stroke:#d6b75c,color:#ffffff

    class Source,Cloud,Target,Catalog,Scanner,ControlAPI,Scheduler,Registry service
    class DB,Stage,Manifest,Queue,Results,Documents storage
    class Dispatcher,Worker1,Worker2,WorkerN,Adapter,BusinessAPI processing
    class Transaction transaction
